2,1,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm so happy to be part of this! I really want to make sure we pick something that works for everyone. I'll look into the bus links in the two outer wards and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops!,"{""words"":42,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To ensure our ambitions are grounded in reality, I shall examine the two programmes begun six years ago and the county grant terms and the endowment.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I believe we should be cautious about the operational side. I will examine the volunteer register and supervision training, as well as the neighbourhood associations and tool certification. Let's see if we actually have the capacity to execute.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I believe we must understand the long-term financial stability of our options. I will look into the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines from last year.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... hello. I want to make sure we don't accidentally leave anyone out. I think I'll look into the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use, and the winter road closures north of the river.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,It sounds like we're all looking at really important things! I love how we're thinking about both the money and the people. I can't wait to see what we find out together!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Yumi. A diverse array of inquiries is the only way to avoid the pitfalls of a narrow perspective. I suspect the archives may hold more truth than our current enthusiasm.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Enthusiasm is a fine motivator, but it is a poor substitute for a skill audit. I am more interested in whether our current roster can actually handle the burden of a new commitment.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, a skill audit is useful, but it must be paired with a sustainable funding model. If the financial structure is flawed, even the most skilled team will eventually lack the resources to operate.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Minako. And Shion. I just hope that whatever we choose doesn't make it harder for some people to get to the library. I'm a bit worried about that.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, don't worry! That's why we're checking the bus links and road closures. We'll make sure everyone can join in on the fun! I'm sure we can find a way to help everyone.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, your optimism is a refreshing tonic. However, I believe we must be careful not to mistake a ""way to help"" for a viable plan. Let us see if the records support such hope.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,Hope is a variable I cannot calculate. I am far more interested in the gap between what we promise the community and what our staff is actually qualified to deliver. Let us proceed to the findings.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,"It is important that we remain objective. While we consider accessibility and staffing, we must ensure the funding is shaped to last beyond the first year. I am ready to review the data.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I'm ready too. I hope the information helps us make a choice that's fair for everyone. I'll wait to see what you all find.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm so excited to see what we discover! I hope the information we find helps us create something wonderful for the whole community. Let's all do our best!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,A most spirited start to our deliberations. I shall now retreat into the quiet of the archives to see if history has any warnings for us. I look forward to our reconvening.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I have a clear picture of what I need. Let us see if the records reveal the incompetence I suspect, or if we actually have the skills to match our ambitions. I am ready.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let us proceed to the findings with a clear mind. I look forward to seeing if the financial records reflect a sustainable path forward for the library system. I am ready.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll go look into those things now. I hope I can be helpful to the group. I'm ready.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
29,1,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
